# Regulation Crowdfunding

## Interpretation — the six readings this encoding is parameterised on

<!-- l4: declare:non-natural investor limit reading -->

**1.** In this Act, “non-natural investor limit reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “revenue or net assets”; or

    (b) “annual income or net worth”.

<!-- l4: declare:twelve month window reading -->

**2.** In this Act, “twelve month window reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “rolling from each closing”; or

    (b) “from the date of such offer or sale”.

<!-- l4: declare:annual income period reading -->

**3.** In this Act, “annual income period reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “the calendar year”; or

    (b) “the investor's own fiscal year”.

<!-- l4: declare:reporting disqualification reading -->

**4.** In this Act, “reporting disqualification reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “presently subject to the reporting requirement”; or

    (b) “ever subject to the reporting requirement”.

<!-- l4: declare:holders of record reading -->

**5.** In this Act, “holders of record reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “the investors who invested in the offering”; or

    (b) “the register of holders of record”.

<!-- l4: declare:one intermediary scope reading -->

**6.** In this Act, “one intermediary scope reading” means one of the following—

    (a) “the prohibition binds the offering”; or

    (b) “the prohibition binds the issuer”.

<!-- l4: declare:Interpretation -->

**7.** In this Act, “Interpretation” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “non-natural investor limit basis”, being a non-natural investor limit reading;

    (b) “twelve month window anchor”, being a twelve month window reading;

    (c) “annual income period”, being an annual income period reading;

    (d) “reporting disqualification tense”, being a reporting disqualification reading;

    (e) “holders of record basis”, being a holders of record reading; and

    (f) “one intermediary scope”, being an one intermediary scope reading.

<!-- l4: decide:the staff reading -->

**8.** The staff reading means Interpretation where non-natural investor limit basis is revenue or net assets, twelve month window anchor is rolling from each closing, annual income period is the calendar year, reporting disqualification tense is presently subject to the reporting requirement, holders of record basis is the investors who invested in the offering and one intermediary scope is the prohibition binds the offering.

<!-- l4: decide:the text alone -->

**9.** The text alone means Interpretation where non-natural investor limit basis is annual income or net worth, twelve month window anchor is from the date of such offer or sale, annual income period is the investor's own fiscal year, reporting disqualification tense is ever subject to the reporting requirement, holders of record basis is the register of holders of record and one intermediary scope is the prohibition binds the issuer.

## The rule-version axis — the seven inflation-indexed constants

<!-- l4: decide:the 2022 inflation adjustment -->

**10.** The 2022 inflation adjustment means YMD with 2022, 9 and 20.

<!-- l4: assume:no encoding of Part 227 exists for rule dates before 2022-09-20 -->

