**12.** The lapse of the COVID-era provisions means YMD with 2023, 3 and 1.

<!-- l4: decide:the rules in force include -->

**13.** In relation to a DATE “change”, the rules in force include means RULES EFFECTIVE DATE is at least change.

<!-- l4: decide:the aggregate offering cap -->

**14.** The aggregate offering cap means if the rules in force include with the 2022 inflation adjustment then 5000000 otherwise no encoding of Part 227 exists for rule dates before 2022-09-20.

